# Provides:          umountfs
# Required-Start:
# Required-Stop:     halt reboot
# Default-Start:
# Default-Stop:      0 6
# Short-Description: Turn off swap and unmount local filesystems (Vita override)
# Description:       Vita override. Stock declares "Required-Stop: umountroot",
#                    which in insserv places umountroot AFTER umountfs. That is
#                    the wrong direction on this platform: the root filesystem
#                    is a loop file stored on an exFAT volume that umountfs
#                    cannot unmount (the loop device holds it open), so it would
#                    remount that volume read-only while / was still writable,
#                    and the later root flush would have nowhere to land.
#
#                    Here umountfs instead runs LAST of the filesystem steps:
#                    umountroot makes / read-only, vita-root-sync flushes the
#                    exFAT volume, and only then does umountfs unmount what is
#                    left.
### END INIT INFO
